WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.094 --> 00:00:02.271
- I'm visiting New York
City right now from L.A.

00:00:02.271 --> 00:00:05.013
and I'm staying with a few of
my friends and I decided that

00:00:05.013 --> 00:00:08.526
what's better to do in New York then eat.

00:00:08.526 --> 00:00:10.111
I'm going to make my friends
take me to all the best

00:00:10.111 --> 00:00:13.611
Instagrammable desserts in New York City.

00:00:14.722 --> 00:00:15.555
- Okay.

00:00:15.555 --> 00:00:16.388
- Sure!

00:00:17.903 --> 00:00:18.736
- Sure!

00:00:18.736 --> 00:00:19.580
- Yes!

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.604
- [Host] Let's do it!

00:00:21.604 --> 00:00:24.842
This city is just waiting to be devoured.

00:00:24.842 --> 00:00:25.675
Let's go!

00:00:25.675 --> 00:00:27.131
So Jill where are you taking me first?

00:00:27.131 --> 00:00:28.795
- We're going to Cookie Dough.

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:30.988
- And what do they have there?

00:00:30.988 --> 00:00:32.286
Cookie dough probably.

00:00:32.286 --> 00:00:33.894
(laughing)

00:00:33.894 --> 00:00:35.702
Rosie are you gonna get some dough?

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:36.952
It's delicious.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:45.418
(camera snapping noise)

00:00:45.418 --> 00:00:46.251
How cute!

00:00:47.251 --> 00:00:49.354
- How many calories do you think that is?

00:00:49.354 --> 00:00:51.592
- Why would you say that
when I'm biting into it?

00:00:51.592 --> 00:00:53.490
Beautiful and delicious.

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:55.057
- Yeah, it tastes just like cookie dough--

00:00:55.057 --> 00:00:56.263
- But it's so good.

00:00:56.263 --> 00:00:57.175
- It's so good.

00:00:57.175 --> 00:00:58.383
(laughing)

00:00:58.383 --> 00:01:00.550
- I don't know how to eat.

00:01:02.098 --> 00:01:03.917
- [Host] That's yours
now, you finish that.

00:01:03.917 --> 00:01:04.750
(laughing)

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:06.718
We got the dogs some cookie dough.

00:01:06.718 --> 00:01:07.551
Yum.

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:11.519
He's also here for the dough.

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:13.536
Okay bye.

00:01:13.536 --> 00:01:15.405
So it was way too cold, dogs are at home,

00:01:15.405 --> 00:01:18.956
and now we're off to
Taiyaki NYC, an ice cream

00:01:18.956 --> 00:01:21.845
place which is perfect for
this 10 degree weather.

00:01:21.845 --> 00:01:23.768
Cream! I'm mesmerized.

00:01:23.768 --> 00:01:24.601
Oh my god.

00:01:28.643 --> 00:01:30.484
- [Woman] Unicorn ears,
oh my god how special.

00:01:30.484 --> 00:01:32.479
- This is the best thing
I've ever gotten in my life.

00:01:32.479 --> 00:01:36.658
(camera snapping noises)

00:01:36.658 --> 00:01:39.575
(electronic music)

00:01:41.919 --> 00:01:43.124
- This is our new unicorn friend.

00:01:43.124 --> 00:01:44.500
- You get to keep it.

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.160
- Look at this thing, look
it's got a little horn.

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:48.522
- [Man] It's really cute.

00:01:48.522 --> 00:01:50.571
- Tastes like a root.

00:01:50.571 --> 00:01:52.129
This almost tastes healthy.

00:01:52.129 --> 00:01:53.032
- That's really good.

00:01:53.032 --> 00:01:54.802
- It's so good, it's kinda like green tea

00:01:54.802 --> 00:01:58.135
and like red bean flavored a little bit.

00:02:00.492 --> 00:02:02.881
- Oh man that's got like
the red bean filling

00:02:02.881 --> 00:02:04.080
in the middle.

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:05.370
- It tastes like magic.

00:02:05.370 --> 00:02:07.616
- [Host] Matt, Matt you're
dripping everywhere.

00:02:07.616 --> 00:02:10.033
Why are you so bad at eating?

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:14.794
We're at Gelso and Grand,
and we are about to learn

00:02:14.794 --> 00:02:17.000
how they make their
Instagram famous cannolis.

00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.195
(camera snapping noise)

00:02:19.195 --> 00:02:22.195
(suspenseful music)

00:02:41.922 --> 00:02:45.501
(shouting and cheering)

00:02:45.501 --> 00:02:47.325
- [Host] It literally, it's everywhere.

00:02:47.325 --> 00:02:48.803
- It looks like nachos now.

00:02:48.803 --> 00:02:51.000
- It's delicious, so amazing.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.278
- You can't really describe
it, it's almost like

00:02:52.278 --> 00:02:54.527
a moussey type thing so that,
I'm officially declaring it

00:02:54.527 --> 00:02:55.827
cannolis are back.

00:02:55.827 --> 00:02:59.023
- [Host] This is definitely,
definitely Instagram worthy.

00:02:59.023 --> 00:03:00.947
The day's almost over but
we have one more stop,

00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:03.379
we're going to Cupcake
Market in East Village,

00:03:03.379 --> 00:03:05.830
we're gonna get their famous face cookies.

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:09.547
(camera snapping noise)

00:03:09.547 --> 00:03:11.074
(easygoing music)

00:03:11.074 --> 00:03:14.245
I love cookies, nobody
loves cookies more than me,

00:03:14.245 --> 00:03:16.956
you love cookies? Nobody
loves cookies, I'm the best.

00:03:16.956 --> 00:03:17.789
I'm the best of cookies.

00:03:17.789 --> 00:03:18.622
Waaah!

00:03:20.804 --> 00:03:23.285
These ones don't have eyeballs.

00:03:23.285 --> 00:03:24.799
Which should we eat?

00:03:24.799 --> 00:03:26.799
- Trump? Probably Trump.

00:03:28.567 --> 00:03:30.264
- Pretty good cookie.

00:03:30.264 --> 00:03:31.818
- [Host] It's got a nice crunch.

00:03:31.818 --> 00:03:34.684
I love this icing, it's
so sweet and sugary

00:03:34.684 --> 00:03:37.757
but not in an overwhelming way.

00:03:37.757 --> 00:03:39.246
Not only is it like super,
super Instagrammable

00:03:39.246 --> 00:03:40.713
obviously
- Delicious.

00:03:40.713 --> 00:03:42.704
- But it's a really good cookie.

00:03:42.704 --> 00:03:45.971
The day is over, thank
you guys for taking me to

00:03:45.971 --> 00:03:48.002
all your favorite dessert
places in New York City.

00:03:48.002 --> 00:03:48.858
- Thanks for coming with us.

00:03:48.858 --> 00:03:49.984
- Yeah thanks for coming.

00:03:49.984 --> 00:03:51.225
- [Host] Nobody loves
cookies more than me,

00:03:51.225 --> 00:03:53.850
you love cookies? Nobody
loves cookies I'm the best.

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:56.433
(upbeat music)

